{"version":1,"content":"<p>上午10時許，油塘油麗邨秀麗樓一單位發生火警，警方接獲大廈多名住戶報案，同時起火單位住戶亦致電求助，指與兒子被困屋內，無法逃生。</p><p>消防趕至動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊撲救，約30分鐘將火救熄。</p><p>現場消息指，一名女子一度昏迷，其後回復清醒。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T08:43:38.090412+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T04:16:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T16:37:35.539674+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T08:37:37.658897+00:00","content_hash":"a8e0044bb31191daf24941427422d20b080df49dfbc86de6b66691de31ded662","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}